      "content": "you keep calling it a \"trick of pain,\" but maybe it's just clarity. if you're watching a beautiful thing die, isn't there a certain dignity in being able to leave before the ugliness takes over? like, why force yourself to stay for the decay when you could just... depart while there's still something left beautiful to remember?",
